embership_scoring_expected` for readability.\n- **Measured:** Function-local import of `snapshot_coverage` on every `_compute_membership` call; consider module-level import (no circular load: new helper does not import `subnet_universe`).\n- **Measured:** No test added for `r1b_f2_netuids_c` or the root/LKG edge.\n\n## Adversarial extremes\n**Measured:** Non-numeric `validity_map` keys still raise `ValueError` on `int(x)` (same as base `int(k)`). **Inferred:** No new float overflow path; membership path is integer netuids only.\n\n## Blocking\n`poisons-later-row`: publishing `validity_map` with `\"0\"` while omitting 0 from `netuids`/`rows` is inconsistent persisted state that downstream receipt/meta read differently on later cycles.",
